## Commands

```bash
# Install dependencies
bun install

# Dev server (Vite on :5173)
bun run dev

# Type-check
bun run lint

# Production build
bun run build

# Preview production build
bun run preview
```

No env file required for local demo. Quote email target is hardcoded in `src/lib/email.ts`.

